# Features

Follow [docs/standards/documentation.md](../../docs/standards/documentation.md) and [docs/features/README.md](../../docs/features/README.md).

- Keep feature code under `src/features/<feature>/`.
- Document behavior under `docs/features/<feature>/` in the same task.
- Update the features index.
- Do not mark unimplemented CRM flows as shipped.
